const WGEO={"pistol":["",""],"shotgun":["",""],"rifle":["",""],"knife":["",""],"axe":["",""],"katana":["",""],"smg":["",""],"sniper":["",""],"revolver":["",""],"carbine":["",""],"shovel":["",""]};
const _WDEC={},_WGEO={};let WGMAT=null;
function wDec(w){if(w in _WDEC)return _WDEC[w];const d=WGEO[w];if(!d)return _WDEC[w]=null;const b=Uint8Array.from(atob(d[0]),c=>c.charCodeAt(0)),q=new Int16Array(b.buffer),c8=Uint8Array.from(atob(d[1]),c=>c.charCodeAt(0));
  const pos=new Float32Array(q.length),mn=[1e9,1e9,1e9],mx=[-1e9,-1e9,-1e9];for(let i=0;i<q.length;i++){pos[i]=q[i]/4000;const a=i%3;if(pos[i]<mn[a])mn[a]=pos[i];if(pos[i]>mx[a])mx[a]=pos[i]}return _WDEC[w]={pos,c8,mn,mx}}
// dark: todo negro con un poco de matiz (Superslow); si no, los colores del modelo
function wGeo(w,dark){const k=w+(dark?'|d':'');if(k in _WGEO)return _WGEO[k];const d=wDec(w);if(!d)return _WGEO[k]=null;const n=d.pos.length,col=new Float32Array(n);
  for(let t=0;t<n/9;t++){let r=d.c8[t*3]/255,g=d.c8[t*3+1]/255,b=d.c8[t*3+2]/255;if(dark){const l=.03+.1*(.299*r+.587*g+.114*b);r=g=b=l}for(let j=0;j<3;j++){col[t*9+j*3]=r;col[t*9+j*3+1]=g;col[t*9+j*3+2]=b}}
  const g=new THREE.BufferGeometry();g.setAttribute('position',new THREE.BufferAttribute(d.pos,3));g.setAttribute('color',new THREE.BufferAttribute(col,3));g.computeVertexNormals();g.computeBoundingSphere();g.userData={mn:d.mn,mx:d.mx};return _WGEO[k]=g}
function wMesh(w){const geo=wGeo(w);if(!geo)return null;if(!WGMAT)WGMAT=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({vertexColors:true,flatShading:true,roughness:.55,metalness:.15,side:THREE.DoubleSide});const m=new THREE.Mesh(geo,WGMAT);m.castShadow=true;return m}
function limb(g,a,b,r1,r2,mat){const A=new THREE.Vector3(...a),B=new THREE.Vector3(...b),L=A.distanceTo(B),m=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(r2,r1,L,7),mat);m.position.copy(A).add(B).multiplyScalar(.5);m.quaternion.setFromUnitVectors(new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0),B.clone().sub(A).normalize());g.add(m);return m}
function fist(g,p,mat,s){const m=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.DodecahedronGeometry(.042*(s||1),0),mat);m.scale.set(1,1.2,1.35);m.position.set(...p);g.add(m);return m}
// mano derecha en la empuñadura; la izquierda en el guardamanos, debajo de la pistola o más abajo en el mango
function makeHands(id,skin,sleeve){const g=new THREE.Group(),sk=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:skin,flatShading:true,roughness:.7}),sl=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:sleeve,flatShading:true,roughness:.85});
  const geo=wGeo(id),u=geo&&geo.userData,front=u?u.mn[2]:-.2,len=u?u.mx[2]-u.mn[2]:.2;
  fist(g,[0,-.045,.005],sk);limb(g,[.005,-.07,.04],[.07,-.2,.36],.036,.03,sk);limb(g,[.07,-.2,.36],[.12,-.3,.7],.052,.046,sl);
  if(['knife','axe','katana','grenade'].includes(id))return g;
  if(id==='shovel'){const z=-.3;fist(g,[0,-.01,z],sk);limb(g,[-.01,-.03,z+.03],[-.14,-.2,z+.4],.036,.03,sk);limb(g,[-.14,-.2,z+.4],[-.22,-.3,z+.75],.052,.046,sl);return g}
  if(len<.45){fist(g,[-.04,-.025,.0],sk,1.05);limb(g,[-.05,-.05,.04],[-.17,-.2,.36],.036,.03,sk);limb(g,[-.17,-.22,.36],[-.26,-.3,.7],.052,.046,sl);return g}
  const fz=front*.62;fist(g,[-.03,.0,fz],sk,1.1);limb(g,[-.05,-.03,fz+.03],[-.2,-.2,fz+.3],.036,.03,sk);limb(g,[-.2,-.2,fz+.3],[-.34,-.28,fz+.62],.052,.046,sl);return g}